1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,263
Camp Happy Trails: fishing on the lake, archery, ghost stories round the firepit,

2
00:00:04,263 --> 00:00:05,633
and screams in the distance.

3
00:00:05,853 --> 00:00:07,603
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:08,433 --> 00:00:12,602
Camp Happy Trails has no special setup and no special rules, so it's the classic

5
00:00:12,602 --> 00:00:13,852
place to learn the game.

6
00:00:14,072 --> 00:00:18,509
The box brings ten Events, five Setup cards, eight Terror cards and eighteen Items.

7
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:23,218
It does have fun achievements to chase, like luring the Killer into the Bear Trap

8
00:00:23,218 --> 00:00:25,904
with the Fireworks, or defeating the Killer in the Lake.

9
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:31,128
A few tips. Get the boat keys: ferrying Victims across the lake speeds up rescues.

10
00:00:31,348 --> 00:00:34,121
The Bow and the Bear Trap are the other standout items.

11
00:00:34,341 --> 00:00:38,495
And it's one of the easier locations in logged games, so it's a good place to try a

12
00:00:38,495 --> 00:00:39,696
tough killer. Good luck.

